        <div class="toc-heading">In This Article</div>
        <ol>
          <li><a href="#moisturisation-science" target="_top">Skin Moisturisation &amp; TEWL</a></li>
          <li><a href="#lotion-formulation" target="_top">Body Lotion Emulsion Formulation</a></li>
